##  New features

* New helper methods to match INA219 class interface:
```
  float getBusVoltage_V(void);
  float getShuntVoltage_mV(void);
  float getCurrent_mA(void);
  float getPower_mW(void);
```


## ⚠️ Warning ⚠️
The unit for `readBusVoltage` has changed _from millivolts to Volts_ in this release.  [See this commit: 7d89e31704dec00b81b88e55bd9c65a50c0473d0]
## ☝️ Warning 👆 


**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit_INA228/compare/1.1.0...2.0.0

